#: personalstats/templates/personalstats/dc_charge.html:375
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Only Supercharging / CCS-style sessions (peak ≥ ~40 kW, or flagged fast "
"charger) are used —\n"
"    home AC and destination charging are excluded. The first ~2 minutes of "
"each session (and any\n"
"    early sample still far below that session’s peak) are dropped so "
"Supercharger power-ramp\n"
"    samples do not pull the curve down. Robust filter further drops sessions "
"with unusually low\n"
"    peak power (typical of V2 stall sharing) and cold / unpreconditioned "
"crawls. V3 vs V4 stalls\n"
"    are not separated: the car caps at its max power either way.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Kun Supercharge-/CCS-økter (topp ≥ ~40 kW eller merket hurtiglader) — "
"hjemme-AC og\n"
"    destination utelates. De første ~2 minuttene av hver økt (og tidlige "
"prøver langt under\n"
"    økttoppen) droppes slik at Supercharger-oppkjøring ikke drar kurven ned. "
"Robust filter\n"
"    fjerner også lave topper (V2-deling) og kalde starter. V3/V4 skilles "
"ikke.\n"
"    "

